title: "Release-Aligned Evaluation for High-Confidence Auditing of Time-Series Forecasts: Evidence from CPI and Industrial Production"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
abstract: "The repository provides release-aligned audit code, forecasting experiments, configurations, synthetic fault benchmarks, a held-out generalization suite, validation tests, and derived results for CPI and industrial-production evaluation. Chao Liu and Yanbin Zhang contributed equally."
